# Production parts for the multi-object 3MF plate deliverable,
# build/tape-strip-rack-plate.3mf (scripts/plate.sh, gate.sh --check).
#
# The parts print SEPARATELY and assemble by hand. A single STL of the
# assembly imports into a slicer as one fused body and prints welded, so the
# plate — four distinct objects — is the deliverable and the assembled render
# stays a preview.
#
# One of each: cradle + spindle + one rack + end-cap is a complete, working
# five-fin rack. Duplicate `rack` in the slicer (or print it again) for the
# ten-fin assembly the preview shows. The joint coupon and the fit proofs are
# not plate parts.
cradle
spindle
rack
end-cap
